        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn IW3BI / IW3BD, Swirl Lever Mortise Cylinder Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Swirl Lever Mortise Cylinder Entryset will bring a rustic sense of the outdoors. The swirled end of lever is reminiscent of the curling tendrils of vines, while the arched ends add to the overall feeling of movement. Acorn's Iron Art Mortise Cylinder Handleset is fabricated with a rare craftsmanship reminiscent of a time when expert anvil artisans, hammer in hand, transformed pure iron into beautiful yet functional designs. The uneven surface of this iron handleset has the texture of naturally weathered iron. It is good for doors with 1-3/4\" - 3\" thicknesses and 2-3/4\" backsets. Available in single cylinder or dummy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/forged-iron-swirl-lever-set-with-round-rose-acorn-iwebi\"><b>Forged Iron Swirl Lever Set With Round Rose</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"2\" border=0\" class=\"text\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Mortise Cylinder Entryset With Swirl Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For exterior and interior use.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy gauge plated steel mortise case.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-friction brass latch bolt.</li>\r\n<li>The deadbolt is made of brass with hardened steel inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Acorn Iron Art Mortise Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" Standard, Optional up to 3\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Stile Width: Recommend 4-1/2” with a 4-1/4” minimum.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ACO-Mortise-Specifications.gif?v=1704354518\" width=\"255\" height=\"273\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Acorn Mortise Lock Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Handleset:</b> Blank trim for non-working doors that does not have a turnpiece or a cylinder. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> A key operates the deadbolt from the exterior while a thumbturn operates it from the interior. The latch is operated by a lever from both the exterior and the interior. Panic Proof: Turning of inside lever will retract both dead-bolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe handing actually refers to the mortise lock, rather than the lever. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Due to the handmade craftsman nature of this product, all dimensions are approximate. DO NOT DRILL ANY HOLES until you have the actual pieces to be mounted.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Swirl Lever Mortise Cylinder Entryset, Acorn IW3BD / IW3BI",
                "description": "Tendril Lever Mortise Cylinder Lockset Acorn IW3BI / IW3BD - The Swirl Lever Mortise Cylinder Entryset will bring a rustic sense of the outdoors. The swirled end of lever is reminiscent of the curling tendrils of vines, while the arched ends add to the overall feeling of movement. Acorn's Iron Art Mortise Cylinder Handleset is fabricated with a rare craftsmanship reminiscent of a time when expert anvil artisans, hammer in hand, transformed pure iron into beautiful yet functional designs. The uneven surface of this iron handleset has the texture of naturally weathered iron. It is good for doors with 1-3/4 inch to 3 inch thicknesses and 2-3/4 inch backsets. Available in single cylinder or dummy functions.",
                "keywords": "Swirl Lever Mortise Cylinder Locksets, Swirl Lever Mortise Cylinder Entrysets, Acorn Iron Art Mortise Cylinder Entrysets, single cylinder handlesets, dummy handlesets, Mortise Cylinder Locksets, mortise lock handlesets, mortise handlesets, Acorn IW3BI, ACO-IW3BI, Acorn IW3BD, Acorn IW3BI / IW3BD, Arched Mortise Cylinder Entryset With Swirl Levers, arched handlesets, Acorn hand forged iron entry door lockset with swirl levers,"
